WEBVTT

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.120
In order to save their abducted princess,

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:17.080
the hero continues his journey,
overcoming many trials.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.200
The path splits.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.740
To the right! We'll proceed to the right!

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.880
Police Moles

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.200
A hoard of demons. It was a trap?!

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:37.910
Fight or fall back? What should we do?!

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:44.700
At that moment, while the heroes
faced a critical decision...

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.160
...the princess was in a similar situation.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:50.080
Yes, the decision to do laundry.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:54.200
Spilled

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:55.040
How careless of me.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.660
Why did I bring my drink to bed?

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:03.200
It will stain by the time the launderers come.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.200
Plus, she found this comforter at a demon murder scene

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.740
I must wash it immediately...
for the sake of a restful night!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.960
"Quest"
"Sleep With a Clean Comforter"

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:48.040
"Sixth Night"
"The Princess' Unwavering Choice"

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.410
I've gathered the big ten for one reason.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:58.580
To discuss the hero, who got lost taking
the wrong path on his way here.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.580
Jeez, he's got no sense of direction.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:06.410
And he keeps encountering monsters
that are too high-leveled for him to beat.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:11.660
At this rate, his whole party will be
defeated before reaching the castle.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.490
That can't happen.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:18.410
The whole point is for him to level up
and for me to beat him at the end!

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:23.290
Then we must figure out how
to get the hero here safely.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.080
What troublesome beings.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:32.830
I must wash this before it stains.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:37.580
But is there a place big enough
to wash a comforter?

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:42.290
If I recall, there's a hero
support item in the vault.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.240
Oh, the Fountain of Purity?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:52.160
The fountain that when its water is clear,
it can purify injuries and poisons?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.160
That'll keep the hero safe.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:01.660
However, if the water is dirtied,
it turns into a normal wash basin.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:04.240
I need something to scrub with...

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.120
Hey!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.350
Bubble Soldier

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.580
This place is off lim--

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:15.100
Wash

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.660
Just in case, I stationed
Bubble Soldier there to guard it.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.160
Nice and lathery.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.580
Perfect precautions!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:24.330
Then we'll block other paths the hero
may wander onto with a Mini Tornado Bomb!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.200
That's a one-of-a-kind item!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.870
"Mini Tornado Bomb"

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.290
Yeah, I saved it in case of emergencies.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.620
All the more--

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.120
Rinse

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:37.660
To fight the hero, it's worth it!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.240
Demon King!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.830
Great! Our plan is perfect!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.410
Not quite.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.330
You're Professor Gearbolt,
professional gadget maker!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.640
Professor Gearbolt

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:55.830
I've already created something
for a situation like this.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.830
Drying rack... rack...

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:04.910
A magnetic item to control the hero's
compass to lead him in any direction.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.330
I call it the Magnespear!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.540
Magnetic force, you say?!

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.700
I see!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.950
Amazing!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.080
Drying rack... drying rack...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.490
I've even created a place to guide him to.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.990
Where is that?!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.160
We will guide him to an electric
demon of my creation.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:33.310
New Gearbolter

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:33.450
Right to New Gearbolter!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.290
Wh-What did you say?!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.290
Aw...

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.540
What a nuisance these are.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:50.450
Worry not. I made it weak
to Light, the hero's element.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.910
You plan to use it to boost
the hero's confidence?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.240
How thoughtful of you!

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.700
That hole...

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:05.450
There is <i>one</i> thing I must warn you about.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.870
What is it?

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.450
I'll stick this up there to hang it.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:15.290
Never let its core come in contact with a magnet.
It would cause a mass malfunction.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:21.620
Who would ever do that
to a precision instrument?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.080
You're right. Who would?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.120
Foolish of me.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.620
Spin-dry

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:44.790
It generates heat when it malfunctions,
but no need for the warning, eh?

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:57.410
Dry

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:03.160
All right! Let's go take
a look at the real thing!

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.160
Yes!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:18.700
You would never think that the sun
doesn't come out at the Demon Castle!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.950
It smells of the sun.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.540
Zzz...

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:34.300
Quest Complete

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.660
Slept on a clean comforter!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.410
I look forward to seeing--

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.620
As punishment for the destruction of vital
weaponry of the demon king's military,

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.450
you get no soft drinks for a week!

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.490
That's all!

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.660
So lenient!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:12.970
"New Gearbolter"

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.240
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.120
We've returned here again.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.160
Okay, let's follow the left path this time!

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:29.490
No demons. This must be the correct path!

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:30.740
All right! Forward!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.240
What's wrong?

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.700
It's a trap!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:43.370
While the hero journeyed
along treacherous paths,

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.450
the changing season brought
chilly winds to the princess.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.370
It's already autumn, huh?

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:55.490
It was sweltering until recently.
Better cover up my stomach.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:57.740
But I'll be okay.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:01.660
I have an item to help me
withstand the cold season!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:08.330
I left my woolen underwear... at home.

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:13.080
Right... and there's no way the Demon Castle
would carry anything so sensible.

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:14.870
Lower body 
breezy as the wind

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.240
Materials

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.240
I have the materials for it.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:24.620
I'll have to make woolen underwear myself
in order to keep warm when I sleep!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.620
"Quest"
"Keep Stomach Warm While Sleeping"

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.290
Princess, we're here to collect your plates.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.740
Oh? What are you making today?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.330
Better not be something crazy again.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.330
Woolen--

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:43.870
I almost forgot! When I was young...

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.740
...I was so happy about my cute woolen undies

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:52.490
Princess!

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:52.490
that I went around showing its design
off to the whole castle.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:57.080
Sya! This is not proper behavior for a princess!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.490
Queen Goodereste

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.290
Mother...

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.660
I was severely scolded.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.410
But my undies are so cute.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.580
You mustn't say that word!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.370
Your dignity is the royal family's dignity!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.540
You mustn't harm it!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:19.740
Huh? So what is it? What are you making?

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.830
I cannot say it aloud. Then I will...

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.700
Under. Wear.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:33.990
I have preserved my dignity here!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.740
I'll crush you.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:40.950
In two seconds?!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.290
It's the start of miscommunication.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:50.370
Okay, I'll need a place to hide
while I make the underwear, too.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:56.120
Demon King, this creation far exceeds
that of New Gearbolter!

00:10:56.120 --> 00:11:01.490
You've finally completed a new weapon
to replace the one that was destroyed!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.370
Yes, I can't wait for its unveiling.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.370
Everyone will be astounded.

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.540
That's right!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.240
I'm having bird beast egg custard today!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:14.160
You really love that stuff, huh?

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.870
Sure do!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:18.620
Why is this place swarming with demons?

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.910
Demon Castle

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.240
Princess! What are you doing?!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.950
You mustn't say that word!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.790
You mustn't... You mustn't...

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.410
Hey, say something!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:43.550
"M a k i n g"

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:43.550
Morse code

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:43.550
"U n d e r w e a r"

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.450
I preserved the royal family's dignity!

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.620
Oh, no! She was--

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.310
Medusian

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.620
Did you understand that, Medusian?!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.910
There's no doubt about it!
She was communicating with the cosmos!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:59.160
S-Say what?!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.820
Revived Monster Shroud

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:04.410
Stop, Princess! I'll tear you to shreds toda--

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.950
I'll use this as a ribbon for my undies.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.990
Boss!

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.910
Curses! What are you scheming today?!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.330
I mustn't say it aloud.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.790
Th-That picture...

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:25.580
No question about it.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.450
A severed Ghost Shroud head!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.240
Underwear

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:34.990
I-It's bad! The princess wants to decapitate us!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.540
Huh? Doesn't she always?

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.580
The princess was stabbing
something to a pulp with needles!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.490
Knitting

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:41.490
What?!

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.620
And she was communicating with the cosmos!

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:45.910
Huh?!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:51.370
What?! The princess is using severed demon heads
as a sacrifice to communicate with the cosmos

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.620
and is making a weapon that'll destroy
the Demon Castle in two seconds?!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.660
Yes!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:57.740
What the heck--

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.950
I'd believe it with this princess!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:02.490
Report this to the demon king!

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:05.200
Be on high alert!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.450
Yeah!

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:09.290
So much commotion.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:15.950
I'll finish my undies quickly
under that dark covering.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:19.080
Dammit! The demon king's nowhere to be found!

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.450
We must report this to him at once!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.330
I wonder what kind of weapon
the princess is making.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:26.910
The princess really does
loathe us for abducting her!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.790
What's the big deal?

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:31.830
What could a lone human girl possibly do to us?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:32.870
I finished!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.080
How strong of a weapon could it be?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.240
All right. I'll head straight back to sleep.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.200
Evil Scissor Princess

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:48.490
Th-There it is!

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.910
R-Run away!

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.370
Where the heck is the demon king?!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.660
I never expected a princess-model weapon.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.620
This is sure to succeed in guiding the hero!

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:05.580
We'll position this in the most obvious place!

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:08.290
That solves our lost hero problem!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.290
Yeah!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:17.080
Finished at last! My secret weapon
against autumn and winter!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:22.660
They're very cute underwear,
but I won't show them off like I used to.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.990
It's not only for the royal family's dignity.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:34.830
Even if they're woolen,
a maiden's underwear is off limits.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:41.080
Though the wind blows,
my stomach stays nice and warm.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.490
Zzz...

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:51.990
Quest Complete

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.410
Slept in warmth.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.200
Wh-What in the world happened?!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:15:00.410
We don't know when the princess
will attack! Prepare to fight!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.370
Yeah!

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:03.790
D-Demon King!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:09.240
And so, the Demon Castle was on high alert...

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.040
A zoo?

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.580
She was making <i>these</i> ?

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:20.200
...until they found the princess' fancy zoo.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:25.900
"Evil Scissor Princess"

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.660
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle.</i>

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.450
Our third try.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.450
Come on! Through the middle path!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.200
They were <i>all</i> traps?!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:57.290
I preserved the royal family's dignity, Mother.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.370
That reminds me...

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:08.330
Sya, I know a special way to fall asleep. I'd--

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:16.620
I can't remember the rest of Mother's sentence.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.740
I'd try it out if I remembered the rest.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.120
The hero... got lost... again...

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.700
What are you doing?

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:41.680
<i>No response</i>

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.870
Are you sleeping?

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.680
<i>No response</i>

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.620
Shall I deliver the final blow?

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:55.990
He finally finished work and his body
will die unless he sleeps,

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.830
but his brain is still wide awake?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.450
What should I do?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.490
He's the demon king.
He'd probably come back to life even if he did die.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.080
And I have no obligation to help...

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:13.410
The Demon Castle will crumble if I die.

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:16.990
My bed!

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:24.620
And so, the princess tried different ways
to get the demon king to sleep.

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.910
Wh-What are you doing?

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.830
We'll start off... with a lullaby.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.290
Well?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.450
Is that some sort of curse?

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.580
Next, we'll try reading.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.830
Wait! Stop!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.670
<i>Demon King learned a loony dance</i>

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.790
Loony dance!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.910
And now a meal.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.160
What do you like? Pasture grass?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.950
These are not cow horns!

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.660
Father! Father!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.160
You won't sleep?!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.740
How would any of that make me sleep?!

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.540
Why won't he fall asleep?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.870
I would've gone "zzz..." three times by now!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.370
Counts by Zzzs

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.370
I would've gone "zzz..." three times by now!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.830
No, wait. He's the demon king.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.950
It wasn't stimulating enough?

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:29.950
Huh?

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:37.040
What are you doing?!
What the heck are you doing?!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.290
It'll help you relax.

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:41.200
Try losing consciousness for a bit.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:47.580
The demon king fell from the sky!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.830
It's my original blend sleep potion.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.290
What the heck's in this?

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.870
Too much! It's <i>way</i> too much!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.410
Actually, how are you <i>not</i> asleep?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.950
Be amazed that I didn't die!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:08.870
How can she treat me so?
Is this really how she puts someone to sleep?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:13.200
Is she actually doing her best
to help me fall asleep?

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.080
Princess.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.450
Hm?

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.490
Is this how you usually fall asleep?

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.660
No.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.040
Then why the hell are you doing it to me?!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:31.410
I knew. I already knew this,
but what a frightening princess she is.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:35.240
She's nearly killing me by trying
to put me to sleep!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:39.080
Should I swallow my pride
and return her to her home?

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:40.400
'Well, he's a demon, so he should be fine' expression

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.410
However...

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.740
I'm sure Father
wouldn't have done so.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.410
You called out to your father earlier, too.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.290
I see, this demon king is a daddy's boy.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.950
I'm more of a mommy's girl.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:02.580
I had such a hard time putting you to sleep.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:03.700
But...

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:10.160
I remember Mother's way to fall asleep.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:17.790
Say, did your father put you to sleep?

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:21.620
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.080
Is that right?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.910
Now's my chance to test it!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.910
There, there.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:39.910
Wh--

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:43.950
There, there. There, there.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.870
There, there.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:46.740
Princess?!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.790
It's okay.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:21:03.370
As I thought. Putting a child to sleep
is the same for both demons and humans.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:08.370
And what Mother said was true.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:14.200
When you watch someone fall asleep like this...

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:19.910
Sya, I had such a hard time
putting you to sleep.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:24.700
But I know a special way to fall asleep.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:30.910
I'd fall asleep next to you
after putting you to sleep.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.200
Zzz...

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:43.910
Moved the princess to bed
so she wouldn't catch a cold

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.490
Zzz...

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:49.580
And so, the demon king's
fatigue was slightly relieved.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.330
Oh, this is...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.160
...the castle we departed from.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.160
Back at square one.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:07.450
Was never discovered despite conspicuous positioning

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:45.370
They say that overeating and
oversleeping don't do the body good,

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:48.540
but eating Demon Castle
ramen to bursting brings me joy.

00:23:48.540 --> 00:23:51.660
And next time,
"Even More Sleepless Princess of the Castle."

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.120
"Even more"? I'm pretty sure the
princess already sleeps year round.

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.120
Unfathomable.

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:56.620
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
